            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Yoko"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this using stevia instead of sugar and without a crust. I zested 2 small lemons, then juiced them. I served it in parfait glasses. It was very good and very pretty. I will make this again.",
            "datePublished": "2015-06-07T15:25:38.493Z"
