              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kat Bresler"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious. I added an extra 1/4 cup of fresh melon juice and reduced the water by the same for extra tartness.",
            "datePublished": "2020-07-12T16:47:51.503Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
