              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ajennerjahn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've made a slight variation on this for years: substitute lime juice instead of lemon juice, increase juice to 1/3 cup (because I like it tart), increase cream cheese to 4 oz, increase cornstarch to 1/4 cup.",
